\ Try it: oled2-init 10 20 oled2-pixel oled2-show   or   oled2-demo (Enter stops it)  ok.
  ok.
oled-init  oled? .  10 20 oled-pixel oled-frame oled-ball oled-show -1  ok.
: diagonal ( -- ) 20 0 do i 2* 10 + i oled2-pixel loop ;  ok.
oled2-init  oled2? .  oled2-frame diagonal oled2-show -1  ok.
oled-move oled-move oled-x @ . oled-y @ . 14 12  ok.
